<title>USA: Equity Residential buys six properties.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential buys six properties.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust said Friday it acquired six properties in separate transactions for a total purchase price of $122.9 million.</p>
<p>The properties, in Colorado, North Carolina, Washington, California and Texas, consist of 2,092 residential units, Equity Residential said.</p>
<p>The company, a real estate investment trust, said it now has investments in 246 properties in 30 states.</p>
<p>Its shares were off 1/4 Friday at 47-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
